---
import SectionLabel from "../../elements/SectionLabel.astro";
import Heading from "../../elements/Heading.astro";
import BodyText from "../../elements/BodyText.astro";
import CTAButton from "../../elements/CTAButton.astro";
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-32">
  <div class="container-default grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="lg:col-span-4">
      <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-32" data-reveal>
        <SectionLabel number="02" text="Why we exist" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-8">
      <Heading size="md" class="max-w-[22ch]" data-reveal>
        Most software is built to hold your attention. Ours is built to hand it
        back to the people in your life.
      </Heading>

      <BodyText class="mt-8 max-w-[58ch]" data-reveal>
        We've built products, platforms, and communities that outgrew us. The
        common thread was never a technology. It was a belief that the best
        thing software can do is put two people in the same room, even when they
        aren't. Troth is that belief, built.
      </BodyText>

      <div class="mt-8" data-reveal>
        <CTAButton href="/about#beliefs" variant="link">
          What we believe
        </CTAButton>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
